<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I wanted to try again because State Farm offices are seeing massive success with our Lead Connection Program (LCS). </span></span></span></span></span>LCS is designed to help boost conversion rates and maintain a steady pipeline of high-intent shoppers by having our outreach team contact your data leads and transfer them to you when they’re ready for a quote.</span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Would you have time to review how this could benefit your office?</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Give me a call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or let’s schedule some time to connect!&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Best,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Sender.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
